# Zero-Downtime Dataflow Pipeline Hot-Swaps
The --update Execution Flag: To deploy a bug fix or code update without halting processing or losing buffered window memory, launch the new pipeline job while passing the --update flag alongside the exact same job name as the currently running pipeline

# Slots, Reservations, and Assignments:
To ensure business-critical financial reporting dashboards never experience slow queries during peak business hours due to other teams running heavy ad-hoc exploratory scans, ```create a dedicated Reservation of slots and assign the production``` dashboard project to it. Assign ad-hoc analyst projects to a separate, lower-priority or flexible autoscaling reservation pool.

